0..73 Comment "// Renaming then substituting is substituting then renaming, when the two"
74..145 Comment "// composites agree at every index; its instance at weakening is that a"
146..214 Comment "// weakened term under a lifted substitution is the substituted term"
215..281 Comment "// weakened. The induction\'s lifted step weakens both sides of the"
282..350 Comment "// hypothesis and commutes the weakening past the lifted renaming by"
351..369 Comment "// `renameSquare`."
371..450 Comment "// The naturals; the syntax; the congruences; the shift\'s lookup, the fusion of"
451..488 Comment "// renamings and the weakened lookup."
